  "user_request_original": "Design a planar multilayer dielectric coating with air incidence on fused_silica substrate. Use exactly 30 layers alternating hfo2 and SiO2 (Lemarchand), starting with hfo2 at the air side. Optimize individual layer thicknesses and the reference quarter-wave center wavelength to maximize transmittance in 1530-1565 nm band and maximize reflectance in 400-700 nm band. Normal incidence assumed. Both polarization states present but unpolarized weighting. Total layer count fixed at 30. Material names: hfo2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), fused_silica.",
